 ('MatplotlibGraphs', 'Components', 'MarkersAndColors', "plt.plot(x, y, marker='o', color='b', label='Line 1')", 'The keyword arguments marker, color and label of plot put a mark on each data point, set the color by name or by one-letter code, and name the line for the legend.', None),
